E AX3073 1203-unsafe-nullary-prim.ax:18:7-27 undeclared-unsafe "`untagged` touches raw memory and its declaration does not say so" #"__resource_unwinding" ?17:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
